  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4e75c6d8df4549344b5728c761399965, type: 3}
  m_Name: Alice Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  contactName: Alice
  dialogueLines:
  - Oh my. It smells like Sea Lavender in here. No, that's not a good thing.
  - If you need help with the pre-calc homework, let me know.
  - If you see Suki in here, tell her to cool it with the fish. No offense.
  - "I\u2019m going to be a florist when I graduate. Maybe we could go into business
    together! A sort of, fish-flower hybrid business."
  - This cutie would go so well in my tank. It's got these fronds that look just
    like coral.
